{"id":"7959e36d1026e950","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-rogers-isomorphism.md","title":"Rogers 可接受编号同构定理","display":"thm-rogers-isomorphism — Rogers 可接受编号同构定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-rogers-isomorphism","aliases":["20-thm-rogers-isomorphism"],"display":"thm-rogers-isomorphism — Rogers 可接受编号同构定理","chapter":"1","section":"1.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 1.7.6；Corollary 2.3.10","source_pdf_pages":[57,72],"source_printed_pages":[21,36],"depends_on":["[[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]","[[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]","[[20-lem-padding]]","[[20-thm-injective-numbering-translation]]","[[20-thm-generalized-myhill]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-rogers-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-rogers-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rogers-isomorphism — Rogers 可接受编号同构定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 1.7.6；Corollary 2.3.10"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57</span><span>72</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>21</span><span>36</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c21e5e4663b12909\" href=\"?note=c21e5e4663b12909\" title=\"20-df-acceptable-numbering\">20-df-acceptable-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d6dc64668d77215\" href=\"?note=2d6dc64668d77215\" title=\"20-df-computable-isomorphism\">20-df-computable-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"582399eb5e892787\" href=\"?note=582399eb5e892787\" title=\"20-thm-injective-numbering-translation\">20-thm-injective-numbering-translation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8bfbf07c0a7ee61b\" href=\"?note=8bfbf07c0a7ee61b\" title=\"20-thm-generalized-myhill\">20-thm-generalized-myhill</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\psi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\psi)\\)</span>；取全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}\">\\(\\psi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\psi_{g(e)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\psi_{g(e)}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c21e5e4663b12909\" href=\"?note=c21e5e4663b12909\" title=\"20-df-acceptable-numbering\">20-df-acceptable-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2d6dc64668d77215\" href=\"?note=2d6dc64668d77215\" title=\"20-df-computable-isomorphism\">20-df-computable-isomorphism</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"582399eb5e892787\" href=\"?note=582399eb5e892787\" title=\"20-thm-injective-numbering-translation\">20-thm-injective-numbering-translation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8bfbf07c0a7ee61b\" href=\"?note=8bfbf07c0a7ee61b\" title=\"20-thm-generalized-myhill\">20-thm-generalized-myhill</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rogers\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\exists p:\\omega\\to\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{CompPerm}(p)\\land\\forall e\\ (\\varphi_e=\\psi_{p(e)})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rogers\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\exists p:\\omega\\to\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{CompPerm}(p)\\land\\forall e\\ (\\varphi_e=\\psi_{p(e)})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>设 padding 的整体单射为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_1(e)=a(f(e),e)\">\\(f_1(e)=a(f(e),e)\\)</span> 是全可计算单射，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{f_1(e)}=\\psi_e\">\\(\\varphi_{f_1(e)}=\\psi_e\\)</span>。向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 的另一方向不能预先假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 已有 padding；直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 应用编号翻译定理，得全可计算单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_1\">\\(g_1\\)</span>，保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_{g_1(e)}=\\varphi_e\">\\(\\psi_{g_1(e)}=\\varphi_e\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>所有部分可计算函数构成可数集；按每个函数的外延值，将标准索引和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 索引分别分成同标号的两组分区 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_n,B_n\">\\(A_n,B_n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_1[A_n]\\subseteq B_n\">\\(g_1[A_n]\\subseteq B_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_1[B_n]\\subseteq A_n\">\\(f_1[B_n]\\subseteq A_n\\)</span>。广义 Myhill 定理只使用这两个有效单射，不需要判定外延相等或有效识别分区块，得到全可计算置换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p[A_n]=B_n\">\\(p[A_n]=B_n\\)</span>。因此对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\psi_{p(e)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\psi_{p(e)}\\)</span>。这完成原书 §1.7 与 §2.3 相互引用的证明接口。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 1.7.6、Exercise 1.7.8、Corollary 2.3.10；印刷 21、36 / PDF 57、72。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-acceptable-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"c21e5e4663b12909","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2d6dc64668d77215","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-padding]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-injective-numbering-translation","status":"resolved","id":"582399eb5e892787","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-injective-numbering-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-generalized-myhill","status":"resolved","id":"8bfbf07c0a7ee61b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-generalized-myhill]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-acceptable-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"c21e5e4663b12909","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]；see [[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-injective-numbering-translation]]；see [[20-thm-generalized-myhill]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2d6dc64668d77215","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-